WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:05.338
With the recent spike in Titan sightings
circulating on social media,

00:00:05.588 --> 00:00:08.925
proactive preparation for a
Titan emergence event is crucial.

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:12.804
A single towering force of nature
has the potential to forever alter

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:14.139
the lives of millions.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:17.142
It is our mission to help you
prepare for that force.

00:00:17.142 --> 00:00:21.312
The Titan Preparedness Plan is your guide
to staying safe in the face of monsters.

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:23.898
These are the three steps
you need to know.

00:00:23.898 --> 00:00:25.734
1. Know Before You Go

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:29.612
Identify the location of your nearest
Titan shelter and practice navigating

00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:32.866
a Titan evacuation route with your
family on a weekly basis.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:35.535
2. Run and Take Cover

00:00:35.618 --> 00:00:39.831
In the case of a Titan emergence,
calmly sprint to the nearest Titan shelter.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.043
If your designated shelter is
inaccessible or at capacity,

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:46.212
seek the basement or lowest floor
of a nearby building.

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:47.756
3. Stay Informed

00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:50.467
Follow any further instruction
from local authorities

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:53.803
and stay informed using your
mobile device, television, or radio.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:58.308
We can't stop a Titan emergence,
but we can safeguard our lives.

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:01.436
Join us in building a safer,
more resilient community.

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:03.521
We are here to protect you.

